      "writtenOn": "2016-04-20T14:22:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not force the test_case here instead of the set_test_case method? That way this can be done in the base classes instead of every test class.",
      "revId": "61665dd27f595b43f0954064939c737e10965a78",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
